{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0122","paragraphs":[{"id":"p87e058fc25e6-1","text":"燕雁无心，太湖西畔随云去。"},{"id":"pa0154a9a5f60-1","text":"数峰清苦。"},{"id":"pff5f70369330-1","text":"商略黄昏雨。"},{"id":"pc8417151ae85-1","text":"第四桥边，拟共天随住。"},{"id":"pc2cc6813eef6-1","text":"今何许。"},{"id":"p8ee0f6283692-1","text":"凭栏怀古。"},{"id":"pd0d7d5ec3ae7-1","text":"残柳参差舞。"}]}